  "title": "Lumbar Epidural Steroid Injections (ESI) for Radiculopathy",
  "jurisdiction": "Medicare Administrative Contractor (MAC) LCD",
  "effective_date": "2023-01-01",
  "category": "Interventional Pain Management",
  "description": "Medicare coverage guidelines for interlaminar and transforaminal epidural steroid injections. Requires documented radicular nerve root pain with positive straight leg raise or dermatomal sensory loss, failure of at least 4 weeks of conservative care, and limitation to a maximum of 4 injection sessions per rolling 12 months.",
